# Environment Variables

Add these to your `.env` file or Vercel project settings:

## Database
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@ep-xxx.region.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require

## Better Auth
BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=your-secret-key-here
BETTER_AUTH_URL=https://your-domain.vercel.app
GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=your-github-client-id
GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=your-github-client-secret

## ImageKit (optional)
IMAGEKIT_PUBLIC_KEY=your-public-key
IMAGEKIT_PRIVATE_KEY=your-private-key
IMAGEKIT_URL_ENDPOINT=https://ik.imagekit.io/your-id

## SMTP (contact form)
SMTP_HOST=smtp.zoho.com
SMTP_PORT=465
SMTP_USER=your-email@zoho.com
SMTP_PASS=your-password
SMTP_FROM=your-email@zoho.com
SMTP_TO=your-email@zoho.com

## Umami Analytics (optional)
PUBLIC_UMAMI_HOST_URL=https://your-umami-domain.com
PUBLIC_UMAMI_WEBSITE_ID=your-website-id
PUBLIC_UMAMI_ENABLED=true
